# TM-01 (+ TM-15): allowedHosts egress gate over VZ's real file-handle NIC.
# allow-listed name fetches; denied direct IP is RST; non-allow-listed name is
# refused at DNS; allow-listed cloud-metadata IP is still refused (SSRF guard).
EGRESS_ALLOWED_OK
EGRESS_DENIED_OK
EGRESS_REFUSED_OK
EGRESS_METADATA_REFUSED_OK
!EGRESS_ALLOWED_FAIL
!EGRESS_DENIED_LEAK
!EGRESS_REFUSED_LEAK
!EGRESS_METADATA_LEAK
